    {
      "about": "While engaged, rotate, point, stop and cut steer the bubble instead of the turning thrusters: pitch and yaw bend the path, roll turns the ship about it. Steering sets a turn rate (fraction × turn rate) that eases in and out over about 0.3 s; dropout leaves no spin.",
